# Target: PGL50 / PG2L50H-6FBG484
# I/O voltage is configured as 3.3 V LVCMOS. Confirm the board banks are powered at 3.3 V before programming.
# 本文件由旧 main501.pcf/main501.ucf 的有效管脚约束改写为 Pango FDC；旧 TIMEGRP/BEL 布局信息未迁入。

